@startuml
title Validator Unit Sequence - Validation Result Production
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Step Composition" as SC
participant "SPU Validator Unit (SPUVU)" as VU
participant "SPUValidatorResult" as VR
participant "SPUExecutionResult[TOutput]" as SER

SC -> VU : invoke validation under Association
VU -> VU : validate(target scope, input)
VU --> VR : produce SPUValidatorResult
VR --> VU : return validation conclusion
VU --> SC : SPUValidatorResult (optional)

note right of SC : Validation conclusions remain domain results,
NOT automatic invocation failures
SPUValidatorResult carried independently
in SPUExecutionResult optional slot
Validator Unit has own behavioral/result contract

@enduml